DSH Skill Ratchet
=================

This repository is a DSH (DeepSeek Harness) port of Darwin Skill 2.1.

Upstream: https://github.com/alchaincyf/darwin-skill
Copyright (c) 2026 alchaincyf (花叔)
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

Modifications for DeepSeek Harness:

- skills live under `~/.dsh/skills` and `<project>/.agents/skills`
- independent judges use the DSH `subagent` tool
- usage-based ordering via `scripts/scan-usage.mjs`
- optional, Windows-friendly result cards
- upstream is a reference; this repository is the source of truth
